<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Balance Druid DPS Phase 4</h3>The legs, much like the hands have a little bit of room for play. <br/>
<br/>For Horde, the 277 tier pants with glove off-piece are about tied with running tier gloves and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50694/plaguebringers-stained-pants">
