<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="two-handed-weapons-for-balance-druid-dps-phase-4">Two-Handed Weapons for Balance Druid DPS Phase 4</h4>Two-handed weapons are generally not as good as a 1h+OH setup, but could still be better than items from the previous phase.<br/>
<br/>
<b>
<ins>Please note:</ins></b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50648/nibelung">
